1869	The following two auxiliary statements use the directly indexed extended-line
1870	carrier. Fix admissible parameters, a projective setting $S$, projective joint
1871	point measurements $Q$ with self-consistency and both opposite-placement
1872	ordered-product squared distances at most $\delta_Q$, and complete paired-line
1873	measurements $T$ with the axis-degree bounds and completed evaluation
1874	consistency defect at most $\delta_P$.
1875	Let $D_{\rm dir}$ be any auxiliary subline distribution of mass one whose
